g\",\n  \"@type\": \"Article\",\n  \"author\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\n    \"name\": \"{{blog-post.author}}\",\n    \"url\": \"{{blog-post.author.url}}\"\n  },\n  \"dateModified\": \"{{blog-post.modified.date}}\",\n  \"datePublished\": \"{{blog-post.publish.date}}\",\n  \"headline\": \"{{blog-post.headline}}\",\n  \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\n    \"@id\": \"{{blog-post.url}}\",\n    \"@type\": \"ItemPage\",\n    \"url\": \"{{blog-post.url}}\"\n  },\n  \"description\": \"{{blog-post.description}}\",\n  \"url\": \"{{blog-post.url}}\",\n  \"image\": {\n    \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n    \"url\": \"{{blog-post.cover.image}}\",\n    \"width\": \"{{blog-post.cover.image.width}}\",\n    \"height\": \"{{blog-post.cover.image.height}}\"\n  },\n  \"publisher\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n    \"name\": \"{{site.name}}\",\n    \"url\": \"{{site.url}}\"\n  }\n}"}],"selectedVariant":"blog-post-blog-posting-preset"},"children":"","custom":false,"disabled":true},{"type":"script","props":{"type":"application/ld+json"},"meta":{"schemaType":"K8ijxs6T","displayName":"Matrix Article Author"},"children":"{   \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",   \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",   \"author\": {     \"@type\": \"Organization\",     \"name\": \"Matrix Massage & Bodywork\",     \"url\": \"https://www.matrixmassage.net/about-5\"   },   \"dateModified\": \"2025-06-02T19:16:24.284Z\",   \"datePublished\": \"2025-06-02T19:01:40.376Z\",   \"headline\": \"Lymphatic Drainage Massage Therapy - Why It Works & Why You Need It\",   \"mainEntityOfPage\": {     \"@id\": \"https://www.matrixmassage.net/post/lymphatic-drainage-why-it-works-why-you-might-need-it\",     \"@type\": \"ItemPage\",     \"url\": \"https://www.matrixmassage.net/post/lymphatic-drainage-why-it-works-why-you-might-need-it\"   },   \"description\": \"Discover the benefits of lymphatic drainage massage therapy - why it works for detox, reducing inflammation, and boosting immunity. Learn why it works.\",   \"url\": \"https://www.matrixmassage.net/post/lymphatic-drainage-why-it-works-why-you-might-need-it\",   \"image\": {     \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",     \"url\": \"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/e4cc43_1fe7fc0981eb46df965a322e27e55e66~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1024,h_1024,al_c,q_85/e4cc43_1fe7fc0981eb46df965a322e27e55e66~mv2.jpg\",     \"width\": \"1024\",     \"height\": \"1024\"   },   \"publisher\": {     \"@type\": \"Organization\",     \"name\": \"Matrix Massage & Bodywork\",     \"url\": \"https://www.matrixmassage.net\"   } }","custom":false,"disabled":false}],"settings":{"preventAutoRedirect":false,"keywords":[{"term":"lymphatic drainage massage therapy - why it works.","isMain":true}]}},"richContent":{"nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"rszpr422","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"At first glance, lymphatic drainage massage might look too gentle to be effective. There’s no deep pressure, no muscle kneading, and yet people often walk away feeling lighter, less inflamed, and even emotionally rebalanced. That’s the power of a well-functioning lymphatic system.","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"hzfew2669","nodes":[{"type":"CAPTION","id":"tc3g22698","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Massage Therapy - Lymphatic Drainage Massage in Salem, WI","decorations":[]}}]}],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"custom":"550"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"e4cc43_1fe7fc0981eb46df965a322e27e55e66~mv2.jpg"},"width":1024,"height":1024},"caption":"Massage Therapy - Lymphatic Drainage Massage in Salem, WI"}},{"type":"DIVIDER","id":"b46y8467","nodes":[],"dividerData":{"containerData":{"width":{},"alignment":"CENTER","spoiler":{},"height":{},"textWrap":false},"lineStyle":"SINGLE","width":"LARGE","alignment":"CENTER"}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"t9ym1495","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"What Is the Lymphatic System, and Why Does It Matter?","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"kwzot509","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"l4qpe515","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"The lymphatic system is your body's unsung hero—an essential part of your immune system responsible for filtering waste, toxins, and excess fluid from the tissues. Unlike the circulatory system, it doesn’t have a heart to pump fluid. It relies on muscle movement, breathing, and manual techniques like lymphatic drainage to stay active.","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"20p0d499","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"310re527","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"The Science-Backed Benefits of Lymphatic Drainage","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ll89k533","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"pb6sn543","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- A 2009 study published in *Lymphology* showed that manual lymph drainage significantly reduced limb volume in patients with lymphedema. ","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"2zr8l555","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- A 2020 review in the *Journal of Manual & Manipulative Therapy* confirmed its effectiveness in reducing post-operative swelling, especially in cosmetic surgery recovery. ","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"gk0sh563","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- Clinical research shows that MLD enhances lymphangiomotor activity (the rhythmic contractions of lymph vessels), improving fluid movement and reducing inflammation.","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"15cus579","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"zdqil595","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Why Is It So Gentle?","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"vjm3h605","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"sdkuc623","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Unlike muscle tissue, lymphatic vessels are located just below the skin’s surface—often within 1-2 millimeters. Applying deep pressure can actually collapse these vessels temporarily, preventing them from doing their job. That’s why true lymphatic drainage uses a specific, feather-light touch with slow, rhythmic movements. When performed properly, it stimulates the valves within your lymph vessels to open and close, moving lymph fluid without stress to the body.","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"u1vdp643","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6luiq663","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"How Do You Know If It’s Working?","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"12ea6675","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"wq66s697","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Here are common signs your body is responding to lymphatic drainage therapy: ","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":16}},{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"yri81710","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- Increased urination within a few hours (a sign that lymphatic waste is being eliminated) ","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"109fe724","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- Reduction in puffiness or swelling—especially in the face, abdomen, or limbs ","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"0a6cu787","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- Feelings of lightness or relaxation","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"1o1u9754","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- Improved energy or reduced brain fog in the following 24–48 hours ","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"zur2c771","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- Better digestion or reduced bloating","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"rucxo739","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"szz2p943","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Who Should Consider It?","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"1si41962","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"awgxh998","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Lymphatic drainage isn’t just for people with lymphedema. It’s also highly beneficial for: ","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":16}},{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"x3ut81018","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- Post-surgical recovery (especially cosmetic procedures) ","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"f9m8o1039","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- Chronic inflammation and autoimmune disorders ","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ixv8p1061","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- Digestive sluggishness or bloating ","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"v6m9y1084","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- Frequent illnesses or feeling run-down ","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"378mq1108","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"- Wellness seekers wanting to detox and feel lighter","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"me0gz1225","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"e87ue1273","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"The Takeaway","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6os411349","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"8ii2z1375","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"This isn’t just a relaxing massage—this is functional, evidence-based therapy for your entire immune and detox system. If you’re feeling swollen, inflamed, tired, or just not quite yourself, your lymphatic system could be crying out for support. Let our Licensed Massage Therapist guide your body back into balance—with a touch so gentle, your body does the heavy lifting on its own.","decorations":[{"type":"FONT_SIZE","fontSizeData":{"unit":"PX","value":14}}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"uuk4q2671","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"vv3r92672","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"f3r211324","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","